      "text": "THE RING OF FIRE IS WAKING UP\n\n4 billion people are standing on one of the most dangerous fault lines on Earth — and it’s rumbling again.\n\nIn October 2025 alone, the Philippines was rocked by multiple massive earthquakes — including a 7.4-magnitude quake followed by a 6.9 aftershock, just weeks after another deadly tremor in Cebu. But this isn’t just about one country… the entire Pacific Ring of Fire is active.\n\nStretching 40,000 km around the Pacific, it’s where 90% of the world’s earthquakes strike — from Japan and Indonesia to California, Chile, and New Zealand. \n\nThese aren’t random events. It’s the collision of giant tectonic plates — the Pacific, Eurasian, Philippine, and North American — each grinding against the other with unimaginable force.\n\nEvery region has its “Big One” coming.\n\nManila’s fault hasn’t moved since 1658.\n\nCalifornia’s San Andreas Fault is long overdue.\n\nJapan’s Nankai Trough has up to an 80% chance of a magnitude 9 quake within 30 years.\n\nAnd when these faults snap, they don’t just shake the ground — they unleash tsunamis, landslides, fires, and chaos that can ripple across oceans.\n\nPreparedness is the only defense:\nKnow your risk zone\nSecure your home\nKeep emergency kits ready\nPractice “Drop, Cover, Hold On”\n\nThe Earth doesn’t warn us — it reminds us. \nStay informed. Stay ready.\n\n✨🙌🏾💫",
